# Personal build wrappers -- they hardcode one machine's N:\ paths.
# Named one by one deliberately. The blanket *.sh / *.bat / *.ps1 patterns that
# used to sit here also matched build.sh, build_linux.sh, appversion.sh,
# glibc_test.sh, appversion.bat and PostBuild.bat, every one of which CI, CMake or
# the MSVC project needs. Those are in the repo only because someone force-added
# them; the next build script added would have been dropped by `git add -A` with
# no warning.
# The trade: this repo is PUBLIC, and a script carrying fleet credentials is no
# longer caught by accident. Add its ignore line before you write it.
/build_linux_wsl.ps1
/build_windows.bat
/build_wsl.bat
/collect_builds.bat
